# docker/Dockerfile builds with the repository root as context. Only the files a
# stage copies are let in: no Git data, secrets, backups, host dependencies or
# build output, so a local image is built from what a CI checkout contains.
# The mobile stage copies only lockfiles, so its per-build `compose build
# mobile` stays a cache hit until one of them changes.
*
!backend
!frontend
!mobile/package.json
!mobile/package-lock.json
!mobile/tool/harden_native_purchases.sh
!docker/nginx.conf
!docker/scripts/test.sh
!docker/scripts/deploy-production.sh

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
backend/.ruff_cache
backend/.pytest_cache
backend/*.egg-info
backend/build
frontend/node_modules
frontend/.next
frontend/out
frontend/*.tsbuildinfo
